Third-party libraries (Libs\), shipped unmodified under their own terms, which
this MIT licence does not cover. Each library's own notice is in its folder.

  LibStub              Kaelten, Cladhaire, ckknight, Mikk, Ammo, Nevcairiel,
                       joshborke. Public domain (its header). Libs/LibStub/LICENSE.txt
  CallbackHandler-1.0  Nevcairiel and the Ace3 Development Team. BSD licence,
                       full text in Libs/CallbackHandler-1.0/LICENSE.txt.
  LibDBIcon-1.0        funkydude. "Ace3 Style BSD" licence, full text in
                       Libs/LibDBIcon-1.0/LICENSE.txt. Its terms forbid
                       redistributing it as a stand-alone library; it ships here
                       embedded, as it is meant to be.
  LibDataBroker-1.1    tekkub. No licence text is published with it: its
                       source repository has none, and its CurseForge page says
                       "All Rights Reserved unless otherwise explicitly stated".
                       Embedded unmodified, as the WoW addon ecosystem embeds it
                       (LibDBIcon requires it).
  ChatThrottleLib      Mikk. Public domain (its header). Paces the guild's
                       hidden addon messages (#15); copied from AltStable.
  LibGlass-1.0         Spotnick2. MIT licence, full text in
                       Libs/LibGlass-1.0/LICENSE. The glass material (#71),
                       embedded by the packager from github.com/Spotnick2/LibGlass.
